  characterName: Amaru Quispe
  promptText: "A foreign mining firm wants to blast apart our sacred Andean peaks
    for lithium. In exchange, they will build the schools my children need. Do I
    trade our mountains and our ancestors\u2019 burial sites for a promise of education?"
  leftAnswer: Yes, accept the schools; children deserve education and hope.
  rightAnswer: No, refuse; protect your mountains and your ancestors.
